sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Cap as 🧾 Captain (POS)
  participant DB as 🔥 Firestore
  participant CF as ⚙️ Cloud Functions
  participant K as 👨‍🍳 Kitchen screen
  participant Cash as 💳 Cashier
  participant G as 📱 Guest
  Cap->>DB: Seat guests at T4 (table → seated)
  Cap->>DB: Add dishes / voice order → Send to kitchen
  DB->>CF: orders onCreate
  CF->>DB: Recalculate totals + GST, create KOTs per station
  DB-->>K: KOT appears (kitchen · tandoor · bar · dessert)
  K->>DB: Tick dishes → Mark ready
  DB-->>Cap: Push: "T4 ready"
  Cap->>DB: Served → Request bill (table → billing)
  Cash->>DB: Charge UPI / cash / card / split
  DB->>CF: status → paid
  CF->>DB: Deduct stock, loyalty points, free table
  CF-->>G: E-bill + feedback link on WhatsApp
